        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Traditional mapo tofu uses silken tofu with pork mince in a fiery Sichuan sauce. This version swaps in mushrooms for a similar soft texture. The doubanjiang paste is the key flavour here. Find it at any Asian supermarket." }]
